{"id":1040301,"chapter_id":1040301,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"审查室的灯没有打开，黑暗中有谁在低诵。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301002,"trial_step":2,"drawing":1040301},{"step":2,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"“你当度过苦厄，跨过这世上所有的丰碑，你当遇见金色的游隼，有翅膀的行者牵引你，去往光明处。光所在处，你定也在那里。”","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1040301},{"step":3,"content":"这首诗，你莫名觉得耳熟。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1040301},{"step":4,"content":"见你到来，橡木匣点了点头，以示问好。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1040301},{"step":5,"content":"她姿态自然地坐在审查椅上，温和地注视着你，似乎她才是这间审查室的掌控者。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1040301},{"step":6,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你来了。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301007,"trial_step":7,"drawing":1040301},{"step":7,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"这一次，你又想从我这里获得什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1040301},{"step":8,"content":"橡木匣的语调平静，听不出波澜，但莫名让你品味出了距离感。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1040301},{"step":9,"content":"一定要说的话，大概是得到你的支持吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1040301},{"step":10,"content":"你轻轻翻开文件夹，上面夹着多张罗马内斯克会堂在黑环发生爆炸后，被摧毁的照片。你将它推至前方，可橡木匣仅仅只是瞥了一眼，便继续注视着你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1040301},{"step":11,"content":"西区锈火事件已经结束了，西区人民及新城市议会都希望尽快展开辛迪加的重建工作。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1040301},{"step":12,"content":"我们也很痛心，罗马内斯克会堂在大战中遭到了严重损毁，但我们已经计划完成对它的修复，并且……为那些在混乱中牺牲的人立起石碑。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1040301},{"step":13,"content":"现下，需要一位对此有了解的人选，协助我们一起工作。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1040301},{"step":14,"content":"我们没有多做考虑，你是我们认为最适合的人选。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1040301},{"step":15,"content":"你原以为，即便橡木匣会露出不屑的表情，她应当也是愿意去修复会堂和那周围的碑林，可没想到，橡木匣出声拒绝了你。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1040303},{"step":16,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"很抱歉，我做不了什么。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1040303},{"step":17,"content":"但……罗马内斯克的碑林数量，死者名录，你都是最清楚的人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1040303},{"step":18,"content":"如果是有什么程序上的顾虑，我会为你提供协助。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1040303},{"step":19,"content":"你轻声劝说着，可橡木匣依旧冷淡着脸，态度没有丝毫松动。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1040303},{"step":20,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"生者导致死者的死亡，而后为了宽慰自身，他们为死者修建碑林、建立档案。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1040303},{"step":21,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"自认为做了这一切，就能还清自己犯下的罪孽，获得死者的原谅。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1040303},{"step":22,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"接着就能高高兴兴地告别过去，继续在这个世界上没有负担地生存下去。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1040303},{"step":23,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"我拒绝参与这一切。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1040303},{"step":24,"content":"说罢，橡木匣向后倚靠在审查椅上，摆出了送客的态度。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1040301},{"step":25,"content":"你误解了我的意思。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1040301},{"step":26,"content":"你叹了口气，耐心地朝橡木匣说道。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1040301},{"step":27,"content":"我们并非是为了自己的面子，也不是为了让自己得到宽慰……而是为了一直铭记这场灾难所留下的疼痛……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1040301},{"step":28,"content":"罗马内斯克会堂为逝者保全死后的尊严，实现生前的执念，它是辛迪加最珍贵的地方之一，也是见证这场灾难的痕迹之一。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1040301},{"step":29,"content":"所以我们才想重建它。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1040301},{"step":30,"content":"橡木匣的态度露出一丝松动，没再继续反驳你的话。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1040305},{"step":31,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"是的……他们所在的地方，是世上最美好的地方……他们是最美好、最静谧、最安全的朋友……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1040305},{"step":32,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"作为生者时，他们是“锈火”的英雄，是流民寨的难民，是我的好邻居。在他们死后……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1040305},{"step":33,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"他们回到罗马内斯克，我把他们打扮成最好看的样子，听他们在生命的最后时刻留下的话语。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1040305},{"step":34,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"顺着他们的呢喃，我解决了许多执念……但他们中，总有一些我无法实现的……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1040305},{"step":35,"content":"能告诉我吗？关于这样的执念？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1040305},{"step":36,"content":"橡木匣笑了笑。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1040302},{"step":37,"content":"她轻盈地挑起手指，似乎在审查室的虚空中，就有什么看不见的人在徘徊，向她哭诉自己的眷恋不舍。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1040302},{"step":38,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"执念的种类很多，各式各样，有孩子抱怨自己从未见过的父母，有成年人无法忘记黑帮杀害他家人的愤怒，有老年人说自己这辈子都没遇见过好事，不知道自己为何活着……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1040301},{"step":39,"content":"这与那个无法解开的执念有关吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1040301},{"step":40,"content":"还是……这些是你拒绝协助的原因之一？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1040301},{"step":41,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1040303},{"step":42,"content":"寂静中，你几乎听不到她呼吸的声音。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1040303},{"step":43,"content":"片刻后，她微微躬下身子，凑近你的脸，异色的双瞳在黑暗里越发诡谲。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1040303},{"step":44,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"回答我吧……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1040303},{"step":45,"content":"耳畔传来的声音冰凉，如同亡者的质问。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1040303},{"step":46,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你相信……未来一定存在希望吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1040303},{"step":47,"options":["相信"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301049,"trial_step":49,"course":3,"drawing":1040303,"choices":[{"text":"相信","goto":50}]},{"step":48,"content":"我相信希望，我也相信你在努力帮助那些丧失希望的人。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1040303},{"step":49,"content":"你没有避开她的凝视，对她说出了你的选择。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1040303},{"step":50,"content":"橡木匣长叹一声，靠在了椅背上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1040301},{"step":51,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"真是个固执的人啊。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1040301},{"step":52,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"那我来给你讲个故事吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1040301},{"step":53,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"一个隼和三只口袋的故事，听过吗？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1040301},{"step":54,"content":"没有。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1040301},{"step":55,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"这个故事是很久以前一位神父说给我听的。据闻，是入夜之前的传说。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1040301},{"step":56,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"在人来到世间的时候，金色的游隼为他们开辟道路，送他们三只口袋，一只里面装着财富，一只里面装着权力，一只里面装着希望。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1040301},{"step":57,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"游隼说，财富的口袋，会在商人聚集的地方找到；权力的口袋，会在战争中找到。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1040301},{"step":58,"content":"我猜，希望的口袋最难找。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1040301},{"step":59,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你在这样的时候总是表现得很聪明。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1040302},{"step":60,"content":"橡木匣轻轻笑了一下，看着你继续说道。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1040302},{"step":61,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"只可惜，那位神父……还没有说完这个故事就死掉了。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1040301},{"step":62,"content":"那名神父，就是留下那个无法解开的执念的人吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1040301},{"step":63,"content":"橡木匣没有回答你的问题，而是对着黑暗轻声念诵起那首有些奇怪的诗。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1040303},{"step":64,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你当度过苦厄，跨过这世上所有的丰碑……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1040303},{"step":65,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"你当遇见金色的游隼，有翅膀的行者牵引你……","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1040303},{"step":66,"content":"她不带情绪地念着，不像是在祝祷，而是在嘲讽这首诗本身。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1040303},{"step":67,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"失去了希望的人……连执念也无法解决。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1040303},{"step":68,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"局长，你认为，希望的口袋要去哪里找到？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1040303},{"step":69,"options":["我曾经找到过","或许现在找不到"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301071,"trial_step":71,"course":3,"drawing":1040303,"choices":[{"text":"我曾经找到过","goto":72},{"text":"或许现在找不到","goto":76}]},{"step":70,"content":"我曾亲手找到过希望的口袋。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1040301},{"step":71,"content":"或许，在现在的世界，希望的口袋很少很少，以至于你接触过的执念、你遇见的逝者，从未见过希望。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1040301},{"step":72,"content":"但世界已经开始改变了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301074,"trial_step":74,"drawing":1040301},{"step":73,"content":"总有一天，希望的口袋会出现在所有人眼前。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1040301,"next":[80]},{"step":74,"content":"或许现在的世界上不存在希望的口袋。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1040301},{"step":75,"content":"但一直有人在和这个糟糕的世界抗争，想要将希望的口袋带回这个世界上。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1040301},{"step":76,"content":"也许我们就是运气很差的一群人，也许入夜后的世界就是这么糟糕，希望已经不再天然存在。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1040301},{"step":77,"content":"但只要坚持下去，总有一天，希望的口袋会出现在所有人眼前。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1040301,"next":[80]},{"step":78,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"在你看来，所有人都可以拥有希望的口袋？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_80"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1040301},{"step":79,"content":"橡木匣注视着你，眼中有一丝兴味。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1040301},{"step":80,"content":"是的，只要愿意坚持下去。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1040301},{"step":81,"content":"我遭遇过许多绝境。但是……我依然站在这里，而不是躺在罗马内斯克的墓碑下面。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1040301},{"step":82,"content":"即便是那个你无法解开的执念，我相信只要去面对它，总有一天，也能找到解开的方法。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1040301},{"step":83,"content":"橡木匣沉默不语。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1040303},{"step":84,"content":"但从枷锁那端，传来了微小的狂厄波动。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1040303},{"step":85,"content":"短时间内，不过几句话，的确无法让她彻底相信希望的未来。但你想让她稍微认识到一些可能性。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1040303},{"step":86,"content":"这样吧，橡木匣。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1040303},{"step":87,"content":"你拿过那份摊开的文件，将上面的照片摘下来，收进了自己的口袋，并在纸上起草了一份申请书。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1040303},{"step":88,"content":"如果生者的角度不能让你理解我的想法，那不如，让死者来断决吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1040303},{"step":89,"content":"橡木匣毫无波澜的脸上，第一次迸发处近乎于“惊讶”的情绪。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1040304},{"step":90,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"让死者决断？你明明连与他们沟通都做不到，要用什么方法进行这场“裁定”呢？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1040304},{"step":91,"content":"我会签署一个文件，让你回流民寨修整罗马内斯克碑林。而我则以借监视的名义与你一起回去。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1040304},{"step":92,"content":"我们一起解开那个执念。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1040304},{"step":93,"content":"听罢你的方案，那双异色的眼瞳绽放出近乎疯狂的神采。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1040304},{"step":94,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"……你很大胆，局长阁下。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1040302},{"step":95,"content":"你很久没有见到过这样的她了——肆无忌惮地，嘲讽着生者的亡灵使者。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1040302},{"step":96,"content":"如果逝者能够认可我……那么，我希望你也能认可我的答案，从此配合我们重建西区。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1040302},{"step":97,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"呵呵呵呵……在窥探死亡之后，还要触碰生死之间的狭缝讯息？","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1040302},{"step":98,"content":"看着你递来的申请书，漂亮端正的签名已经签在监管者的名称后面，橡木匣拿起桌上的签字笔，签上了自己的姓名。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301100,"trial_step":100,"drawing":1040301},{"step":99,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"很好，我答应你。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1040301},{"step":100,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"我会尽全力协助你——但你要触碰罗马内斯克的墓碑，聆听亡者的絮语，哪怕精神无法承受也不能离开。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1040301},{"step":101,"speaker":"橡木匣","content":"不要让我失望。","voice":["vo_trial_40301_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_oak_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1040301},{"step":102,"content":"离开审查室时，橡木匣比之前看起来“愉悦”了许多。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301104,"trial_step":104},{"step":103,"content":"你用最快的速度完成了申请文件，但夜莺仍有些担心。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301105,"trial_step":105},{"step":104,"content":"你反复强调“橡木匣曾经帮过我们许多次，不会有事的”，最终还是让她松了口。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":140301106,"trial_step":106}]}